Another excellent game was ruined by a panic.  I was playing with a nurse, when
she teleported away.  I used my blindfold to find her.  I waited some moves but
the nurse stood still, she made even a single move.  Then I teleported beside
her but she didn't hit me.  I thought that maybe she is sleeping and hit her
and then the computer said

"You destroy the giant ant"

And then PANIC hit and I died.  Such is life (or death).

The last message was ERROR: relmon: mon not in list

Two days' work lost, how can I explain to my boss!?!?  AAAAARGH! :-)

By the way, how about adding a new potion in the game.  Drinking a bottle of
TABASCO could give the player fire resistance, but also take a lot of hp's
if he doesn't have it already.

Motto:
real hackers are killed only by software bugs.



